resources from Windscribe Desktop App, v2.26.2, commit
5578945964760be0bf234c506fdbcbcfe07c974d.
Source: https://github.com/Windscribe/Desktop-App/tree/5578945964760be0bf234c506fdbcbcfe07c974d
