Gozar changes in the imported UI include connection-panel controls and
navigation; location search, favourites, list rendering and tray menu;
preferences controls and links; high-DPI icons, font rendering, and Persian
font fallback. The generated resource map substitutes the Gozar wordmark
and excludes the upstream Windscribe spinner. The Flutter launcher includes
selected Windscribe SVG assets under desktop_flutter/assets/windscribe.

